Feature: Cleanup and Refactoring of AI Suite
  As an AI Suite Developer
  I want to clean up the source code, refactor the structure, and remove unnecessary files or redundant functions
  So that the AI suite is cleaner and easier to maintain
  While ensuring that the self-evolution core function and tdd-team skill are not broken.

  Scenario: Refactoring the AI suite structure
    Given the AI suite source code
    When I clean up unnecessary files and redundant functions
    Then the self-evolution core function must remain fully functional
    And the tdd-team skill must not be broken
    And the isolation of AI suite and AI suite developing agent must be maintained
